<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - ARIS Corp started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - ARIS Corp started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said it initiated coverage of ARIS Corp with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- DMG was the lead underwriter of ARIS' June 18 initial public offering.</p>
